1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,020
Crown Prince of the White House today.

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:04,940
Your Majesty, over to you.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:23,320
Mr. President, thank you for your gracious hospitality

4
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:26,620
according to me and my delegation today.

5
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:30,140
My visit today carries an added meaning

6
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:33,400
as our country's this year mark 75 years

7
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:35,220
of exemplary strategic partnership.

8
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:39,580
However, we had hoped we would be marking

9
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:43,040
this major milestone during better circumstances

10
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:45,260
in my region and the world.

11
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:48,140
Unfortunately, one of the most devastating wars

12
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:52,160
in recent history continues to unfold in Gaza as we speak.

13
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:56,240
Nearly 100,000 people have been killed,

14
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,720
injured, or are missing.

15
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:02,260
The majority are women and children.

16
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:06,320
We cannot afford an Israeli attack on Rafah.

17
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:10,820
It is certain to produce another humanitarian catastrophe.

18
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:14,240
The situation is already unbearable

19
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:16,200
for over a million people

20
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:20,160
who have been pushed into Rafah since the war started.

21
00:01:20,620 --> 00:01:24,060
We cannot stand by and let this continue.

22
00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:28,060
We need a lasting ceasefire now.

23
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:29,880
This war must end.

24
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:33,120
We must urgently and immediately work

25
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:35,140
to ensure the sustainable delivery

26
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:37,220
of sufficient aid to Gaza

27
00:01:37,220 --> 00:01:40,680
through all possible entry points and mechanisms.

28
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,800
And I thank you, Mr. President,

29
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:44,340
for your support on this.

30
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:48,040
Restrictions of vital relief aid and medical items

31
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:50,160
are leading to inhumane conditions.

32
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:54,720
No other UN agency can do what ANRWA is doing

33
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,960
in helping the people of Gaza

34
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:59,480
through this humanitarian catastrophe.

35
00:01:59,980 --> 00:02:02,980
Its work in other areas of operation,

36
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:03,900
especially in Jordan,

37
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:07,240
where 2.3 million are registered,

38
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:08,620
is also vital.

39
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:12,260
It is imperative that ANRWA continues

40
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:14,060
to receive the support it needs

41
00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:15,800
to carry out its mandate.

42
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:19,960
The potential threat of Palestinian displacement

43
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:22,860
beyond the borders of Gaza and the West Bank

44
00:02:22,860 --> 00:02:26,340
is something we view with extreme concern

45
00:02:26,340 --> 00:02:28,220
and cannot be allowed.

46
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:30,740
At the same time, we must ignore,

47
00:02:31,260 --> 00:02:32,900
we must not ignore,

48
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:35,100
the situation in the West Bank

49
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:37,640
and in the holy sites in Jerusalem.

50
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:40,380
Nearly 400 Palestinians have been killed

51
00:02:40,380 --> 00:02:42,300
in the West Bank since October 7,

52
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:45,160
including almost 100 children

53
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:47,160
and over 4,000 injured.

54
00:02:48,420 --> 00:02:50,600
Continued escalations by extremist settlers

55
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:52,920
in the West Bank and Jerusalem's holy sites

56
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:56,020
and the expansion of illegal settlements

57
00:02:56,020 --> 00:02:59,380
will unleash chaos on the entire region.

58
00:03:00,380 --> 00:03:02,320
The vast majority of Muslim worshippers

59
00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:05,220
are not being allowed to enter Al-Aqsa Mosque.

60
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,660
Christian churches have also voiced concerns

61
00:03:08,660 --> 00:03:11,420
about increasing and unprecedented restrictions

62
00:03:11,420 --> 00:03:12,680
and threats.

63
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:15,940
It is also important to stress

64
00:03:15,940 --> 00:03:18,220
that the separation of the West Bank and Gaza

65
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:19,780
cannot be accepted.

66
00:03:20,740 --> 00:03:23,260
Seven decades of occupation, death and destruction

67
00:03:23,260 --> 00:03:25,000
have proven beyond any doubt

68
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,500
that there can be no peace

69
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:29,240
without a political horizon.

70
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:31,940
Military and security solutions

71
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:33,400
are not the answer.

72
00:03:34,260 --> 00:03:35,600
They can never bring peace.

73
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:38,500
Civilians on both sides continue to pay

74
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:41,900
for this protracted conflict with their lives.

75
00:03:42,940 --> 00:03:45,280
All attacks against innocent civilians,

76
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,220
women and children,

77
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:48,540
including those of October 7,

78
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:51,420
cannot be accepted by any Muslim,

79
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,780
as I had previously stressed.

80
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:56,260
We must make sure the horrors

81
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:59,500
of the past few months since October 7

82
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:02,520
are never repeated nor accepted

83
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,380
by any human being.

84
00:04:05,180 --> 00:04:06,700
We must, together,

85
00:04:07,380 --> 00:04:08,440
along with Arab partners

86
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,740
and the international community,

87
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:11,660
step up efforts

88
00:04:11,660 --> 00:04:14,000
to reach a ceasefire in Gaza

89
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,880
and immediately start working

90
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:17,500
to create a political horizon

91
00:04:17,500 --> 00:04:20,580
that leads to a just and comprehensive peace

92
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:23,620
on the basis of the two-state solution.

93
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:26,040
An independent, sovereign,

94
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,620
and viable Palestinian state

95
00:04:27,620 --> 00:04:30,180
with East Jerusalem as its capital.

96
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,500
But living side by side

97
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:33,900
with Israel

98
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:36,180
in peace and security,

99
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,540
this is the only solution

100
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:41,320
that will guarantee peace and security

101
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:43,040
for the Palestinians

102
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,480
and the Israelis

103
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:47,080
as well as the entire region.

104
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,100
Your leadership,

105
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,700
my dear friend, Mr. President,

106
00:04:51,260 --> 00:04:53,300
is key to addressing this conflict,

107
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,600
and Jordan is ready to work,

108
00:04:55,660 --> 00:04:56,180
as always,

109
00:04:56,620 --> 00:04:58,520
with you towards peace.

110
00:04:59,180 --> 00:04:59,680
Thank you.

